{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/1c64a2d0167c1c818e00be91cea3e803.avif?t=1759756955\" width=630 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong> You've been accepted as a participant in a new TV show! You'll be living with 7 strangers for a month, and romance is <i>strongly</i> encouraged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/90499188dc381c7a12606b0652e1b2f1.poster.avif?t=1759756955\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/90499188dc381c7a12606b0652e1b2f1.webm?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/90499188dc381c7a12606b0652e1b2f1.mp4?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tune in to the show</i> is an adult visual novel focusing on characters, story, romance, and sex. At the same time, it doesn't take itself <i>too</i> seriously. Apart from the very first one, all of the sex scenes in the game can be avoided with specific dialogue options, so you can choose if you want to romance all of the love interests, just one of them, or any combination at all. <strong>HINT</strong>: The game won't punish you for pursuing all of the ladies ;) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/bdd43cf1d070954907dd4b4be1c95e7d.poster.avif?t=1759756955\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/bdd43cf1d070954907dd4b4be1c95e7d.webm?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/bdd43cf1d070954907dd4b4be1c95e7d.mp4?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > over 5,500 renders </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >219 animations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 in-game days </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 69 Steam achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 59 music tracks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/9c90aff44882ce9ef7a50c25009b104b.poster.avif?t=1759756955\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/9c90aff44882ce9ef7a50c25009b104b.webm?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/9c90aff44882ce9ef7a50c25009b104b.mp4?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting of a TV show makes it easier for you to get to know all of the lovely participants, as you'll get paired up with them for various missions throughout the month. Sounds almost too good to be true? Well, thinking about it, some things about this show <i>are</i> pretty suspicious, aren't they? You might want to look into that. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/3410698fdd1dd489e4865028b9658e9e.poster.avif?t=1759756955\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/3410698fdd1dd489e4865028b9658e9e.webm?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/3410698fdd1dd489e4865028b9658e9e.mp4?t=1759756955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Markn\u2019t","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/313b9071c701a1dfb92f7273eb2bdfc7a188e0e1.jpg"},{"name":"A fine addition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/8eab190718f02040a31cd1218bcb967e14b9ee8e.jpg"},{"name":"Nice to meet you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/83618022f44b4bf0b356a6a0d3fb614e625aec67.jpg"},{"name":"Into my arms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/7648d0b914e2a8dae9235258b286aa772fa98821.jpg"},{"name":"The mind reader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/42ac59de9a7568da0cf2416620749481a8832d93.jpg"},{"name":"Tell us something about yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/5f53ab5d20a413e97b526fc6e1f67d203bdb18f6.jpg"},{"name":"Talking under the moonlight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/df5dd1a2d04f54ddca58ae3bcc1a2bbcfeb8e076.jpg"},{"name":"Stargazing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/a0f0a276846973e0056f6a741c1a6b0eb6bc288b.jpg"},{"name":"Driver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/de6e629017e56d11974e98ec46649a3ab41cccae.jpg"},{"name":"Passenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2203590/